<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab militants carried out a deadly ambush near the Kenya-Somalia border, killing eight people in Mandera and also attacked road workers in Kenya. Somali Danab commandos launched operations in Middle Shabelle to dismantle Al-Shabaab extortion networks, while US forces conducted overnight airstrikes against ISIS positions in Puntland. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQdk1XU216eUFxRzdTN0dUMl9tejJwcEhMMUNaZ0NEUFkybGN4cWQ2blY4VjREakhMVnJhY3hCdUZzdEN3TDV1cENrTmY0Z25TM1NTVHY0Z0VoU2dBV0ZNaGxVUTlsRFRwaTVXM3BFSmhuNnA2LTY0UUV3QVE3V0NOSXZ1TmdXcGYwSkxTSjVaeHY1S21zVW5WU19MOFE5Vmg5dkdUcFZaUXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNQzRTTFlYakw2WUUybFk0OWdoMzVxbHR3ckFLbVVnb21DRmJOenFVb3ZSS3lDWDlvTXZuUG9fOFcyN3JrUko0MERUMWVwTXRTQm9qUjcxRk1xaWNqbENuSmpEeS1MQzhLWmpiaXRsU2U4ZFhiWnFjbGtCbEtjSENOS3h1b1hJdW5RR3BvcWRBUVVlLXhNNzRocEtoTFRGM1BuaDVSc3lvdTltdk1lT0VQU1ZjOWRsQ2U4YkUyU2FfSldCZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQSVA5T3lveHE2aHFTamtFWVhMV3hBYVdUY2FTS0pRLVZpdVRfUktGeFBaeWFRY01XemRTQnNwdnJMZnQ2eUlOeUxsNjE3MFVORmtweWFoTG42LXZTaUlISzRrc0hZNXZ3YkFmLXlCbWxDZzlkNTIzTWV4ZmFlRUxpcXZYVV9WN242M194VUlzQmZrUDVTN3V5Sg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star, Kenya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNN1VpOXM4UGNzazlJLWY5TnIxVmgtLXd6NVlVb3JxREJoRkpoaFlXcUxWaVRRamM0ZVlhX0JmOVJXcnpWbGtXQ0dFcVd5Q1l2LTVMTzJESFhuR2ZkSkZKWlpnRTVqWTNGX05hWWN4Y2szVUlRWkF4cWtBNDk1aU9hTFhETVR1VmF1cllSSEhFTWw0elpHRkoxLTE5Ymx0OGVpbnQ3dDBxZ1hKaG42MTEwVkJXXzFqLVZFSWtndm9vaDZOUXBuOFFGZjJoQVM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&